  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "After a command reaches game-svc",
      "items": [
        "GameClient calls game-svc over gRPC (chess.game.v1.GameCommands) with a 5 s deadline; errors map back to HTTP exceptions",
        "GameGrpcController hands the request to GameCommandHandler; in-game commands first check the caller is a player",
        "GameService calls GameRepository.update(id, mutate): load snapshot \u2192 Game.fromSnapshot \u2192 mutate \u2192 Lua CAS save, retried on version conflict",
        "Moves go through GameProcess (validation, check, mate); the save also refreshes lobby and per-user views",
        "SocketEventPublisher turns the game's domain events into Socket.IO emits via redis-emitter; core's Redis adapter delivers them to rooms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Async side effects",
      "items": [
        "active \u2192 ended: the same Lua save XADDs a GameEndedEvent to {chess}:events",
        "EventStream reads it in consumer group history; GameHistoryConsumer saves it to Postgres if both players are authorized, deduped by matchId",
        "Failed events are reclaimed after 30 s and moved to {chess}:events:dead after 5 deliveries",
        "GameClock (leader only) scans deadlines every 1 s and ends timed-out games via endByTimeout; browsers count clocks down locally"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "core business relations",
      "items": [
        "UserService.create \u2192 AuthService.createSession on signup",
        "Stripe webhook \u2192 PaymentsService \u2192 UserService.topUpBalance",
        "Socket handshake: ConnectionPatchProvider \u2192 TokenService / AuthService",
        "IsBalanceEnough guard \u2192 BalanceModel \u2192 Postgres user balance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Shared infrastructure",
      "items": [
        "Redis carries game state, read views, the event stream and Socket.IO pub/sub; RabbitMQ is gone",
        "core reads lobby and user views straight from Redis through GameReadModel",
        "OTel SDK (traces, metrics, logs), winston logger, /health/live + /health/ready, gRPC health service in game-svc"
      ]
    }
  ]
}